{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_07",
  "title": "制动失灵",
  "storyCode": "RS-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "43da1bbdbe96c314c7a8b22966772992d59c626955bc9ce686c8ef59feb98555",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你打算在这里坐到什么时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他已经发现了这里，迟早会来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他来了，你打算怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "杀了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "杀害外国使节可是重罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到时候再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么你不是谢拉格人，却愿意为谢拉格做这么多事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯的野心，也是“为了谢拉格”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "到了今天，谁还能否认，他即使有自己的野心，这份野心里也包含了“为了谢拉格”的部分呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这大概是他最不愿意听到的赞美了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还没回答我的问题呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当恩希欧迪斯和我提到耶拉冈德或许确实存在时，我想过或许有一天，我可以和所谓的神明交手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "现在看来是没指望了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "毕竟，恩希欧迪斯已经没这个打算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果他有这个打算，你真的会对抗可能真实存在的耶拉冈德吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也许？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在这里，只有雪崩的时候才能找些刺激，如果真有这样的机会，我可以尝试一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你觉得你会赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，即使是对抗雪崩，我也从没赢过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我懂了，你享受的是挑战的过程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而正发生在这片土地上的事情，你觉得是值得你挑战的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没你想的那么伟大，我是这么长大的，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......这句话真不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "回去吧，锏小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你的战场不在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果这是圣女的意思，恕我难以从命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的战场，由我自己选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果说，这是耶拉冈德的意思呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......那么，为什么由你来传达耶拉冈德的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是圣女大人的侍女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是说，圣女的意思，就是耶拉冈德的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或者说，耶拉冈德会支持圣女大人的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我猜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果黑骑士不是个蠢人，那么，比起四处追我，她一定会守在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她知道我会回来，就像我也知道我会回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，但愿我能活着回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是我早一些猜到问题的中心在这里——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，我猜不到。又有谁能想到，恩希欧迪斯胆子大到敢把一国之信仰当作自己野心的幌子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不愧是被公爵阁下投资的人物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而那位圣女，她对这一切真的一点都不了解吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "锏呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道，她真的心大到这种地步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是......石头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "来者所为何事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我只是一名虔诚的信徒，为了在近处瞻仰神的面貌而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祂累了，今天祂想要休息。\n明天再来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我听说耶拉冈德欢迎外来者的信仰，难道这只是一句戏言？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "虔诚之人不必自证，不诚之人口舌无用。\n祂说，你今日不可再向前一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "若我非要向前呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”环视四周，这里是银心湖边的主干道，平时就非常热闹，而他的突然出现，引起了许多人的注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他猛地扇了自己一巴掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦，那个人什么时候出现在那里的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看，他忽然扇自己巴掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他不会疯了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”没有理会周围的人，只是转身面向耶拉冈德像的方向，学着那些虔诚的信徒一般，做了一个祈祷的动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德保佑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这是他踏上这片土地之后，第一次做这件事。\n然后，他转身离开，没有片刻犹豫。\n他并没有注意到，不远处，一双眼睛也在看着他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "锏不是多嘴的人，应该不会把这件事告诉恩雅吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且，我做的也不算过分吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅儿",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，我就说了，要当旁观者可是很难的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她叹了口气，转过身，像是一个在抱怨妹妹提的要求有些棘手的姐姐一般，瞬息融入人海之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "站住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，长官，你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是这样的，今天晚上银心湖边不是要举办一场小型晚会吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是来取酒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我确实收到过这样的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "跟我来，我需要和那边确认一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "站在这里别动，你搜一下他的身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "两位，我只是个送酒的，有必要这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "特殊时期，见谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你说的都是真的，我们再向你道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，恐怕两位不用向我道歉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒商按下腰间的一个装置，室内的摄像头忽然开始不自然地转动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有敌——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山雪鬼B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两名山雪鬼倒下后，酒商迅速地来到终端前进行一番操作。\n随着他的操作，角落的几个摄像头在短暂停顿后，又恢复正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "事先调查过了，谢拉格采购的是上一代的操作系统，那两个漏洞可是很致命的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "推荐你们购买下一代产品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然，如果谢拉格愿意成为维多利亚的一部分，那就可以免费获得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒商松了口气，但是，他立刻弯下了腰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶——我的伤口要裂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "黑骑士的破坏力，果然不是开玩笑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，黑骑士毕竟做不到全知全能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至于耶拉冈德......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再说吧。至少祂没有阻止我找到这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒商重新站起身子，缓步走向附近的酒桶。\n酒桶很重，但是，当他凑近后，立刻察觉到，空气中并没有酒的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "酒桶中存放的，根本不是酒，而是金属。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我调查过谢拉格的金属采购量，当时并没有从中看出问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但如果说，用来建造雕像的金属，并没有全都被用来建造雕像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，剩下的金属去了哪里呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些酒桶里的金属，接下来又会去哪里呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......哈哈，我就说，黑骑士的力气虽然恐怖，应该也不至于到削铁如泥的地步，原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他立刻转身回到终端前操作。\n随着他在键盘上的不断敲击，一张张图表在屏幕上不断弹出。\n半晌，他终于站起身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒商？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "总之......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "距离晚会还有几个小时——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就让我看一看吧，恩希欧迪斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你真的愚蠢到想要对抗维多利亚吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也就是说，你见到了你的父亲，然后给了他一脚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没错，超解气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然一开始我也没有很生气，但是，我一看到他想摆出父亲的样子我就忽然很想踹他一脚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，干得好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这么说来，我刚来谢拉格的时候和阿克托斯族长也有过一面之缘，只是后面就没遇见过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是我能记清楚他的长相的话，你就不会走这么多弯路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，你说实话，我真的长得和他挺像的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，仔细想想，他蓄的那把胡子......就算我昨天和阿克托斯族长喝过酒，也没有那么容易认出来呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就说嘛，那样子哪里像美男子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或许......剃掉胡子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我什么都没说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇，你看，那边好多驮兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看来，附近的村民们也都来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想必这会是一个美好的夜晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有驮兽在顶你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "噢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "莉莉，这不是莉莉吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，这孩子，看到你就跑过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好啊，好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大叔，这就是你说的莉莉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊，她是我来到谢拉格遇到的第一只驮兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也是我在这里交到的最好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哦，我的小可爱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（粗犷的鸣叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃，我可以摸摸她吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然，莉莉很亲人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（亲昵的鸣叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她中意你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，罗莎琳，你果然是有谢拉格的血脉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇哦，她在舔我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想坐到她的身上去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然，是吧，老雷昂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，去吧，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好欸，大叔，扶我一把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "抓住我的手，一、二、三——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（兴奋的鸣叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哇，莉莉真的好稳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我跟着莉莉去逛一逛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "去吧去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啧啧，真是个活泼的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可不是吗，我女儿小时候也这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "给你这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "上好的奶酪，今天才做出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我记得你快要回去了吧，特意给你做了一块，寻思今晚应该能遇到你，就给带上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这怎么好意思，你家的奶酪可是要卖钱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有什么不好意思的，你也帮我的家人和驮兽看过许多次病了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要说的话，还是我欠你医药费呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就把这块奶酪当医药费吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈，好啊，好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没有比这更好的离别礼物了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "实话说，一开始，我们都还是提防着你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是这一个月相处下来，都当你是好朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伤感的话我就不说了，你下次来的时候，可别忘了来我的牧场做客啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一定，一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "雷昂大叔，你也认识子爵阁下吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这不是圣女大人吗，是啊，老哈洛德现在在我们村子里可是大红人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "原来如此，希望你和你的驮兽们都能玩得开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好好好，能见到圣女大人我已经很开心啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好一场欢庆的晚会啊，圣女大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然明天的仪式才是重头戏，但是普通民众只能通过媒体转播观看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以我才特意筹备了这样一场晚会，为的就是让所有民众都享受到这种节日的氛围。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不愧是圣女大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那位“灰礼帽”阁下呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "或许他这个人比较阴暗，不太喜欢热闹的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不不不，子爵阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然我确实不太喜欢热闹的地方，但是这和性格可没有关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谢拉格的风光太好，一时忘了时间，圣女大人见谅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您能喜欢谢拉格的风景自然再好不过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今夜，希望您也能享受这场晚会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "对了，我带了酒，哈洛德，你这位朋友喝酒吗？一起喝一点吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”向哈洛德隐蔽地递了个手势。\n那是军队中的手势，意思是回避。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......抱歉，老雷昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "酒可能要等一等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莉莉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（高昂的鸣叫）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大叔，我回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咦，人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他被他穿黑色衣服的朋友喊走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“约翰”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......别吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "子爵阁下，希望您在今晚的宴会上玩得还算开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在被你叫走之前，我确实还挺开心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那太好了，因为接下来，您会不开心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "湖心岛的耶拉冈德像，在那底下有一些秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "军人讨厌秘密这个词，“约翰·史密斯”先生，为我们解开它，正是你们的工作，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可惜，我无法解开它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这可不像“灰礼帽”会说出的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我受到了一些阻拦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那么，我是不是可以理解为，你失败了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然我无法探明那里面究竟有什么，但是，在那里受到阻拦本身，就足以证明我的方向是正确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“灰礼帽”从怀中掏出一叠东西，里面有的是照片，有的是文档，有的是笔记。\n哈洛德拿起其中的一些看了两眼，马上，刚才的笑容就凝固在了脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "运酒的车厢中装载的货物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "异铁的实际流向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "运输路线的规划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有的情报都指向一个事实——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在湖心岛的地下，一定隐藏着恩希欧迪斯......不，是这个国家最不可告人的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......她走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让一名谢拉格政要的女儿听到这些话可不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是个军人，我只管打仗。这是你们情报人员该关心的事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她在之前，连自己是谁的女儿都不清楚，又能做些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是能让她认清这个国家的状况早些离开，或许也不是一件坏事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这样她就只是一位乌萨斯国民了。我可不敢得罪乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我发现，我之前对你或许有些误判，“灰礼帽”阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "彼此彼此，子爵阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们这样的人，互相提防着点，对彼此都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好一句大实话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这句实话你爱听，下一句就未必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是不能空手回去的，子爵阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我希望你真的明白。这是恩希欧迪斯欠公爵阁下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他越界了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是这样说服自己的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你应该比我更擅长这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰礼帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "英雄阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴会还在继续着。\n人们围在篝火旁载歌载舞，迎接即将到来的明天。\n在他们的脑海中，明天一定是光明的，喜庆的，欢腾的，令人发自内心想要起舞高歌的。\n哈洛德想，大概只有自己没有办法这么想了。\n他忽然感觉有点冷。\n他上一次感觉冷的时候，是刚来到这片土地的时候。\n他觉得自己需要一瓶酒，或者不止一瓶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈洛德，我等了你半天了，嗝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老牧民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你再不来，酒我都要喝完了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，瞧我，有好酒怎么少得了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来来来，今晚，我们不醉不归！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶，好重的酒味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "头儿，又去哪儿潇洒了，喝酒不带上兄弟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快看，头儿！快看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那该死的驮兽盲盒，除了隐藏款我们都凑齐三套了，这是不是喀兰贸易的阴谋啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他走向房间深处拿起遥控器，不断变换着投影机的内容。\n每一张都是与谢拉格有关的情报，可能的行军路线，军事基地的位置，岗哨的分布，山雪鬼相关的调查——\n在他抵达谢拉格的一周内，这些情报就已经被整理完成放在了他的面前，但他一遍又一遍地要求自己遗忘这些东西。\n以至于大部分内容他反而背下来了。\n他丢开遥控器，抓过手边的折叠躺椅，展开它，把自己埋入其中，闭上眼。\n比起地图和沙盘，他更喜欢听着积雪从树枝上抖落时的簌簌声，这会让他回想起麦浪发出的声响——\n沙沙，沙沙——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "头儿？怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别管他，估计喝蒙了。继续说刚才的话题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老练的士兵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我听说莱塔尼亚要多一座新城了，主打一个对外贸易，你看看这优惠政策，是不是划算疯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但现实总是事与愿违。\n就像他的父亲永远会严厉地要求他离开麦田，回家继续他的训练。\n就像烟斗柄不知何时缺了一截。\n就像他断掉的腿再也回不来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嬉闹声渐小，他的士兵们齐齐看向他。\n他的士兵们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有人换上实弹，待命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明天清晨开始行动，目标是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "耶拉冈德像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "声音有些沙哑。\n麦浪声停止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
